WEBVTT

00:10:29.371 --> 00:10:33.246
the context of human society beyond its
literal definition as somewhat pleasing

00:10:33.246 --> 00:10:36.287
or entertaining. I do not believe
there to be any such thing

00:10:36.287 --> 00:10:38.871
as INTERESTINGNESS except
in the mind of a human

00:10:38.871 --> 00:10:40.996
or other sentient being
that to my knowledge,

00:10:40.996 --> 00:10:43.954
this is an entirely subjective state
that varies from person to person.

00:10:44.454 --> 00:10:47.662
However, I will grant that this is
an interesting question to ask.

00:10:48.246 --> 00:10:51.079
This does not mean it has been answered.
There is no answer to be found.

00:10:51.579 --> 00:10:57.412
Well, so you can agree that somewhere
between profound and gibberish